<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>命门 on 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%91%BD%E9%97%A8/</link><description>Recent content in 命门 on 观颐斋</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Fri, 26 Jun 2026 15:39:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%91%BD%E9%97%A8/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>十四论命门</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-27-lunmingmen/</link><pubDate>Fri, 26 Jun 2026 15:36:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-27-lunmingmen/</guid><description>本节为《石室秘录》附篇“十四论命门”，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;论述命门为十二经之主的根本原理及调治大法，&lt;strong&gt;张仲景真人&lt;/strong&gt;作评，&lt;strong&gt;李子永&lt;/strong&gt;附识。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;命门为先天无形之火，藏于肾水之中，十二脏腑皆赖此火温养。治当于水中补火，火中补水，使火生于水而复藏于水，切忌寒凉克伐&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>